<title>CANADA: Quebecor Printing buys St Louis printer.</title>
<headline>Quebecor Printing buys St Louis printer.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quebecor Printing Inc said on Tuesday it bought 81.3 percent of Sayers Communications Group, a St Louis, Missouri-based commercial printer.</p>
<p>Quebecor Printing said Sayers generates sales of more than US$40 million each year. The purchase also includes Sayers unit Nova Marketing Services, which provides special event promotion program planning, direct fulfillment, distribution and project management for large U.S. companies.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
